.TH MXPI-LAUNCHER 1 "July 2026" "MX Package Installer 26.07.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mxpi-launcher \- compatibility launcher for MX Package Installer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mxpi-launcher
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mxpi-launcher
starts
.BR mx-packageinstaller .
It is retained as a compatibility command for older integrations.
All options are passed to
.BR mx-packageinstaller .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mx-packageinstaller (1)
